// Program arguments (M6 Task 10).
//
// `args()` is not provided yet. `main` is emitted as `i32 @main()` with no
// `argc`/`argv`, so the process's argument vector never reaches a Yashy program.
// Changing the entry signature would make every program pay for a feature most
// do not use; the plan records the trade rather than half-implementing it.
//
// The CLI's own `yashy run -- <args>` forwards arguments to the child process;
// the child can read them once this module lands.
//
// Ownership: nothing is created or consumed.
